      "writtenOn": "2024-02-21T05:30:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Updated comment with logs @ https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/324347502#comment2\n\nAdding new User , callback will not be called with the roles for the new user.\nOnly on Switching the User which is expected to update default message app for the new user , callback will be called with the roles for the new user.\n\nNote: \n1.Wrt to Delete user scenario , on deleting see that callback with the roles changed may need to be handled with seperate listner (UserLifecycleListener) which gives information about user removed.\n\n2.On Bootup, although delete User information is removed from cache since no user exists on query all users, but when delete user was done before reboot, cache was not updated\n\n3.This scenario would like to go with follow Up CL. (Delete User Case)",
      "parentUuid": "888d6399_fdaa1489",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 80,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 81
      },
      "revId": "d3049e5a89dce35563117cd256e512dc9f2c6ee2",
