      "writtenOn": "2024-02-22T10:11:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for verifying these scenarios, I also tried this locally.\n\n\u003e Only on Switching the User which is expected to update default message app for the new user , callback will be called with the roles for the new user.\n\nIt seems the new user setup is done when we first switch to new users.\nSo I assume this behavior is fine.\n\nAs for delete scenario, it\u0027s not great to keep increasing the map size but this should be a minor issue since it\u0027s not usual to create thousands of users and delete them without reboot.\nCould you add a TODO comment to explain the delete user scenario?",
      "parentUuid": "dd72b81a_459d221b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 80,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 81
      },
