      "writtenOn": "2024-02-22T16:59:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "max number of users allowed to be created is Owner + 3 users Only . \n\nDelete scenario to be handled because : \n- User1 and User2 uid is part of ML Request.\n\n- If User2 is deleted , there is no callback about user2 has been deleted, until \n  SatelliteAccessController finds out at Reboot and keep the updated cache list.\n  \n- Hence at the scenario, using UserLifecycleListener , callback can be received \n  when user removed , and this can be used to update uid list @ \n  SatelliteAccessController and ML Layer request can also be updated.\n  \nTODO Buganiser created @ b/326373613",
